            "value" : "at 符號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At their declared lengths the columns pass InnoDB's 8,126-byte record limit, so this one is %@, which does not enforce a length." : {
      "comment" : "A description of a MySQL column that is too long to fit in a MySQL row. The argument is the spelling of the column type.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À leurs longueurs déclarées, les colonnes dépassent la limite de enregistrement de 8 126 octets d'InnoDB, donc celle-ci est %@, ce qui ne force pas de longueur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At their declared lengths the columns pass MySQL's 65,535-byte row limit, so this one is %@, which does not enforce a length." : {
      "comment" : "A description of a column that is too long to fit in a MySQL row. The argument is the spelling of the column type.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À leurs longueurs déclarées, les colonnes dépassent la limite de lignes de 65 535 octets de MySQL, donc celle-ci est %@, ce qui ne fixe pas de longueur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At their declared lengths the key's columns pass the %1$@ bytes this engine can index, so this one is %2$@." : {
      "comment" : "A warning that a key's column is cut to a shorter spelling than its declared length. The first argument is the maximum number of bytes the engine can index. The second argument is the spelling of the column.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À leurs longueurs déclarées, les colonnes de la clé passent les %1$@ octets que ce moteur peut indexer, donc celui-ci est %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach a connection to this conversation first." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when a conversation is missing a connection.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attachez d'abord une connexion à cette conversation."
